# Repository Knowledge Documents

This directory stores consumer-local knowledge documents for this repository.
These documents are descriptive. They must not override canonical policy owners
such as `AGENTS.md`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, skills, validators, or
owned files.

## Required Documents

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `docs/repository-context.md` | Repository role, responsibilities, goals, and vocabulary. |
| `docs/architecture.md` | Current boundaries, components, interfaces, and key flows. |
| `docs/tech.md` | Technologies, tooling, validation surface, and constraints. |
| `docs/structure.md` | Top-level layout, path responsibilities, and placement boundaries. |

## Diagram Standard

Use Mermaid for embedded diagrams when a diagram improves clarity.

## Maintenance

- Keep claims evidence-based.
- Keep unknown facts explicit as `Unknown / To verify`.
- Update the smallest valid owner when repository evidence changes.
